ize:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Synovial\r\nFluid for PAP stain<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>MICROSCOPIC\r\nFINDINGS <\/span><\/u><\/b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0<b>:<\/b><\/span><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\nPAP stained smear shows the presence of a few<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\nmixed population of neutrophilis and lymphoid <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\ncells, in the background of hemorrhage.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>IMPRESSION<\/span><\/u><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <b>:<\/b><\/span><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>No granuloma\/\r\nNo atypical epithelial cells.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n<b>NB:<\/b> Please correlate clinically.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>ENCLOSED<\/span><\/u><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n<b>:<\/b><\/span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\r\nOne smear (PAP)<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n(SDC\/76\/15)<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>\u00a0<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justif